      "importHeal": "strip_bare_tokens",
      "demoteAfterHeal": true,
      "notes": "Chat 真脏 BLOCK。导入：strip 愈后残留 soft 不硬拦（SH-IMPORT-DIRTY-NONBLOCK）；禁静默拆手脸；配方适配≠改 VD；importOk≠designExitPass"
    },
